 "text": "FOR FOUNDER-LED CPA FIRMS DOING $50K/MONTH+\n\nWe Install A Custom AI System Into Your CPA Boutique That Cuts Monthly Close In Half — In 14 Days.\n\nIf your monthly close cycle is not cut by 50% in the first 30 days, you do not pay the retainer.\n\n★\n★\n★\n★\n★\n4.9\nExcellent\nTrusted by founder-led firms\n42+\nFirms Installed\n14\nDays To Go Live\n50%\nClose Cut, Guaranteed\nBook Your Free AI Strategy Call\nWe take 3 new firms per month. 1 spot remaining for July.\nHere's what stops most CPA boutique founders from installing AI. We solve all of them.\n❌\n\"Off-the-shelf AI tools don't understand my vertical.\"\n→\n✅\nThat's the point. Botkeeper, Karbon AI, Neo.Tax build for generalist firms. We build for dental DSO compliance, e-commerce sales tax nexus, restaurant tip accounting, real estate cost seg.\n❌\n\"My senior CPAs spend half the month on close.\"\n→\n✅\nMonthly close: 5 days down to 1. The system pulls from QuickBooks, payroll, Dentrix, or Buildium. Drafts statements. Flags anomalies. Senior CPA reviews and ships.\n❌\n\"Clients are paranoid about AI touching their books.\"\n→\n✅\nNumbers are pulled, never generated. Source-linked. SOC 2 aligned architecture. Scoped credentials per client. No shared model training. One-page security brief on request.\n❌\n\"How do I know it'll actually save money?\"\n→\n✅\nWe guarantee it. If monthly close doesn't drop 50% in 30 days, you don't pay the retainer. A senior CPA hire is $150K-$200K and 6 months to ramp. This is $10K plus retainer, 14 days.\nOne recent install: a boutique tax & advisory firm.\nTAX & ADVISORY • 2 PARTNERS, 6 STAFF\n\nSenior CPAs went from buried in busywork to billing advisory — same team, no new hires.\n\n~$1.4M/year firm. AI installed one workflow at a time.\n\n~11 hrs\nReclaimed per senior CPA, every week\n2 days → <60 sec\nClient lead response time\n~$210K\nAdded advisory revenue in year one\n\nSenior repetitive work dropped from 50% of their time to 18% — the freed hours went straight to billable advisory.\n\n★\n★\n★\n★\n★\n4.9\nExcellent\nTrusted by founder-led firms\nReady to get your senior CPAs out of monthly close?\n\nBook your AI Strategy Call — we'll audit your firm before we talk, so the call is a working session, not a pitch.\n\nBook Your Free AI Strategy Call\n \nWe take 3 new firms per month. 1 spot remaining for July.\nReprise AI. Built for industry-specialist CPA boutiques.\nThis website is not part of the YouTube, Google, or Facebook website; Google Inc or Facebook Inc. This site is NOT endorsed by YouTube, Google or Facebook in any way. FACEBOOK is a trademark of FACEBOOK Inc. YOUTUBE is a trademark of GOOGLE Inc.",
